reviews.text:
I’m dumbfounded by how good this place is! I discovered it as I tried but failed to check out their next door neighbor Thanh-Huong (they were closed). I am glad I had a chance to check this place out! I’m a Bahn Mi noob so take it for what it’s worth... BUT THIS IS THE BEST BAHN MI I HAVE TRIED TO DATE (check my photos). I got the Grilled Pork Bahn Mi which was recommended to me. $4.50 for mouth watering flavorful pork. I added some of their chili sauce for an extra kick. I also checked out their #14 (sorry forgot the name) which was a rice and pork dish with fish sauce and a cucumber lettuce salad. It was excellent as well! And the service is as friendly as it gets here! The lady who served me is so nice! I highly recommend this place!
- Adam from Appetite + Adventure
